    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Restaurant is displayed at the bottom of the screen, allowing you to run your own restaurant while taking care of other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u5206\u9694\u6761.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire an employee\uff1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire pumpkin men or cats as your restaurant staff. Your restaurant needs waiters, chefs and <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u56fe\u6807-\u6536\u94f6\u5458.png?t=1754781702\" /></span>cashiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees have random attribute values, select employees with better attributes and assign them appropriate positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, special employees will appear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect recipes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen needs to be equipped with different types of recipes. The richer the recipes, the stronger the kitchen effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recipes can be upgraded to improve their properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, special recipes will appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u56fe\u7247_\u98df\u8c31_\u526f\u672c.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Receive guests:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customers have limited patience. If their patience runs out, they will leave the restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping restaurants with efficient staff, richer menus and more decorations can help customers spend more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restaurant construction:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small restaurant and expand it after earning enough coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich decorations, can be arranged according to your own preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u56fe\u7247_\u88c5\u9970\u54c1_\u526f\u672c_2.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u5206\u9694\u6761.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to add the Wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Wishlist\u3011can make developers more motivated and complete game development faster and better. Thank you very much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/4cd92bfebca541615c2ed7d7cb3e0d24.poster.avif?t=1754781702\" width=620 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/4cd92bfebca541615c2ed7d7cb3e0d24.webm?t=1754781702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/4cd92bfebca541615c2ed7d7cb3e0d24.mp4?t=1754781702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Restaurant is displayed at the bottom of the screen, allowing you to run your own restaurant while taking care of other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u5206\u9694\u6761.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire an employee\uff1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire pumpkin men or cats as your restaurant staff. Your restaurant needs waiters, chefs and <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u56fe\u6807-\u6536\u94f6\u5458.png?t=1754781702\" /></span>cashiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees have random attribute values, select employees with better attributes and assign them appropriate positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, special employees will appear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect recipes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen needs to be equipped with different types of recipes. The richer the recipes, the stronger the kitchen effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recipes can be upgraded to improve their properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, special recipes will appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u56fe\u7247_\u98df\u8c31_\u526f\u672c.png?t=1754781702\" /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Receive guests:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customers have